{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0001", "offset": 3, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "「고족유 묘지명」의 교감 판독문은 『唐代墓誌彙編續集』(이하 ‘『續集』’), 『全唐文補遺(第五輯)』(이하 ‘『補遺(5輯)』’), 『洛陽新獲墓誌』(이하 ‘『洛陽新獲』’), 『洛陽出土少數民族墓誌匯編』(이하 ‘『洛陽少數』’), 拜根興 2001, 李文基 2001, 拜根興 2012 등을 참조하여 작성했다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0002", "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "夫 扶(이문기 2001, 447쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0003", "offset": 51, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "着 著(『補遺(5輯)』229쪽; 『洛陽新獲』219쪽; 『續集』348쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽; 拜根興 2001, 307쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0004", "offset": 95, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "君 미판독(『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0005", "offset": 140, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "[承昔] 마멸되어 판독하기 힘든 글자이다. 『補遺(5輯)』229쪽, 『續集』348쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽 등에서는 판독불능자로 처리했다. 뒤의 ‘[昔]‘자를 ’世’자로도 추독하지만(배근흥 2001, 307쪽), 뒤 문구의 ‘今’과 대구를 이루는 ‘昔’자일 가능성이 더 높다(『洛陽新獲』219쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0006", "offset": 143, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "兎 菟(『續集』348쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0007", "offset": 155, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "罄 ‘聲’자로 판독하기도 한다(『續集』348쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽; 拜根興 2001; 307쪽).", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0008", "offset": 156, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "▨ ‘大’자로 판독하거나 추독하기도 한다(『續集』348쪽; 拜根興 2013, 279쪽).", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0009", "offset": 186, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "▨ ‘蒙’자(이문기 2001, 449쪽) 또는 ‘尋’자(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 拜根興 2001, 397쪽; 拜根興 2013, 279쪽) 등으로 추독하지만, 자획이 거의 보이지 않는다. 다른 묘지명에는 ‘蒙授’라는 표현이 관용어로 많이 사용되지만, 이 묘지명에는 한 번도 나오지 않는다. 일단 판독 불능자로 처리한다. 『續集』348쪽에서는 空隔으로 처리했다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0010", "offset": 355, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "登 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽, 『續集』348쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0011", "offset": 371, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "眷 자획이 잘 보이지 않는데, ‘卷’으로도 판독한다(『續集』348쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0012", "offset": 377, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "湯沃 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0013", "offset": 416, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 13, "text": "豫 자획이 잘 보이지 않는데, ‘像’으로도 판독한다(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽).", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0014", "offset": 455, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 14, "text": "下 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽, 『續集』348쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0015", "offset": 505, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 15, "text": "勅 敕(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽, 『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽). 이하 동일하다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0016", "offset": 519, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 16, "text": "[大] 미판독(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0017", "offset": 539, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 17, "text": "[之] 미판독(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0018", "offset": 544, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 18, "text": "仞 忍(이문기 2001, 451쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0019", "offset": 603, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 19, "text": "傍 旁(拜根興 2001, 308쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0020", "offset": 613, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 20, "text": "悔 晦(이문기 2001, 452쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0021", "offset": 620, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 21, "text": "慙 慚(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0022", "offset": 625, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 22, "text": "周 君(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽), 載(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0023", "offset": 666, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 23, "text": "[歲] 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0024", "offset": 709, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 24, "text": "下[機] ‘機’자는 자획이 잘 보이지 않는데 추독한 것임. 두 글자 모두 미판독하거나(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『續集』349쪽) ‘下’자만 판독하기도 한다(『洛陽少數』311쪽).", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0025", "offset": 724, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 25, "text": "震 宸(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0026", "offset": 751, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 26, "text": "伯 佰(『續集』349쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0027", "offset": 756, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 27, "text": "伯 佰(『續集』349쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0028", "offset": 825, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 28, "text": "埏 誕(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0029", "offset": 868, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 29, "text": "[生] 자획이 불분명한데 추독한 것임. 미판독(『洛陽新獲』220쪽; 『續集』349)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0030", "offset": 874, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 30, "text": "[死] 자획이 불분명한데 추독한 것임. 미판독(『洛陽新獲』220쪽; 『續集』349)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0031", "offset": 880, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 31, "text": "不 미판독(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0032", "offset": 922, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 32, "text": "[君臣] 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0033", "offset": 938, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 33, "text": "▨ 英(『續集』349쪽, 『洛陽少數』311쪽). 자획의 상하단에는 ‘英’자의 초두변 및 하단 자획과 비슷한 각자흔이 확인됨.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0034", "offset": 944, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 34, "text": "占 其(拜根興 2001, 309쪽). 미판독(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0035", "offset": 945, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 35, "text": "門 미판독(『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0036", "offset": 948, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 36, "text": "歎 嘆(『洛陽新獲』220쪽; 이문기 2001, 452쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0037", "offset": 961, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 37, "text": "▨ 내용상 ‘海’자일 가능성이 높다(拜根興 2001, 309쪽).", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0038", "offset": 963, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 38, "text": "禎 相(『續集』349쪽; 拜根興 2013, 280쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0039", "offset": 997, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 39, "text": "潛 潜(『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1020, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 40, "text": "其一", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0040", "offset": 1028, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 41, "text": "朱 珠(이문기 2001, 452쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0041", "offset": 1036, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 42, "text": "▨ 誠(『洛陽新獲』220쪽; 이문기 2001, 452쪽). 以(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『續集』 349쪽; 『洛陽少數』 311쪽; 拜根興 2001, 452쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0042", "offset": 1059, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 43, "text": "[中淸] ▨以(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽), 미판독(『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1060, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 44, "text": "其二", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0043", "offset": 1096, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 45, "text": "▨ 자획의 하단은 ‘亮’자에 가깝다. 이에 ‘亮’으로 판독하기도 함(『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』 311쪽; 拜根興 2012, 280쪽). 『洛陽新獲』220쪽의 판독문은 ‘亮’자에 가까우나 읽기 어렵다. ‘穴’자로도 판독한다(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 拜根興 2001, 309쪽),", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1108, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 46, "text": "其三", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1146, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 47, "text": "其四", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0044", "offset": 1162, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 48, "text": "摽 標(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽; 拜根興 2001, 309쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0045", "offset": 1165, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 49, "text": "唅 含(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0046", "offset": 1176, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 50, "text": "天 君(『洛陽新獲』220쪽; 『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』311쪽; 이문기 2001, 452쪽; 拜根興 2012, 280쪽), 載(『補遺(5輯)』230쪽; 拜根興 2001, 309쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1188, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 51, "text": "其五", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0047", "offset": 1202, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 52, "text": "象 爲(『洛陽少數』312쪽). 탁본상 자획의 상단은 ‘象’자와 유사하며, 하단은 ‘爲’자와 유사한데 의미상 ‘象’자의 오각으로 보인다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": null, "offset": 1226, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 53, "text": "其六", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_007_0010_0100_gskh_007_0010_0100_0020", "id": "gskh_007_0010_0100_0020_0048", "offset": 1236, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 54, "text": "栢 ‘柏’(『補遺』5輯 230쪽; 『續集』349쪽; 『洛陽少數』312쪽; 배근흥 2001, 309쪽)", "type": "각주"}
